The dragon-engine adaptation borrows 4 methodologies from HarnessKit:

  ① Skill manager (unified frontmatter schema + enabled/disabled flag)
  ② MCP registry (transport = stdio/http/sse + OAuth + status snapshot)
  ③ Hook chain (pre/post ToolUse decision chain coherence)
  ④ Config sync (inventory vs registry bidirectional diff)

